WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.198 --> 00:00:04.740
Recover a project’s goal, current position and next step.

2
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:08.439
Keep source conversations and exact evidence within reach.

3
00:00:08.439 --> 00:00:12.678
See real project activity and the work that needs attention.

4
00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:15.697
Browse reusable project, team and role templates by domain.

5
00:00:15.697 --> 00:00:19.731
Preview the brief, deliverables and acceptance criteria before use.

6
00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:22.739
Science workflows include reproducibility and independent review.

7
00:00:22.739 --> 00:00:25.760
Education workflows turn learning goals into practical deliverables.

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.816
Teams connect specialized roles. Choose members and models separately.

9
00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:32.962
Role instructions define responsibilities and expected outputs.

10
00:00:32.962 --> 00:00:36.467
Templates save configuration. Actual execution needs a compatible executor.
